          "date": "2026-11-08",
          "version": "v3.12.32",
          "text": "New In the Agent Command Center, open the ”…” menu in the session header to see its MCP servers, turn one on or off, or re-authenticate. If a local agent rejects the first prompt, Desktop puts the text back in the composer and shows the reason. You can correct it and resend without retyping. Changed The editor now uses VS Code 1.141.2 and Electron 43.8.3, which includes Chromium security fixes. In IDE mode, opening Devin settings opens an editor tab instead of switching modes. Chat diffs use your editor theme’s diff colors. Shell commands and code blocks in the transcript use its syntax highl…"
