          "date": "2026-11-09",
          "version": "1.15.39",
          "text": "## What's Changed ### Documentation - Document the `apps_not_connected` error on `/kickoff` and `/status` ## Contributors @joaomdmoura"
        },
        {
          "date": "2026-11-08",
          "version": "1.15.38",
          "text": "## What's Changed ### Features - Make gpt-6-luna crewAI's default model everywhere - Read spreadsheet URLs in an agent's input with tools over every row - Tag eval usage spans with target and a per-evaluation id - Add --no-open to crewai eval for headless use ### Bug Fixes - Count a crewai eval run that exits with an error as run_failed - Create the project .env owner-only when crewai eval turns tracing on - Upload a failed anonymous run that crewai eval started - Check openai-compatible providers' API key on the first call - Scope memoized crew methods to their instance - Exit non-zero when…"
        }
